  "bots/tools.message-bot": "Sends another of the person's bots a message without waiting for an answer: a heads-up, a hand-off, or something it should act on in its own job. It reads it as its next turn after the person's own messages, marked as from you; nothing it writes comes back to you. Use ask_bot instead when you need its answer, and list_bots for its id. It does not see this chat, so say everything it needs. At most {{peerMessagesPerTurn}} messages to other bots a turn, and never a token, key or password.",
